## Why This Is Asked
Assess ability to design privacy-preserving computations on Android, with strict process isolation, plugin architecture, and governance. Demonstrates depth in security, IPC, and testing of complex data flows.

## Key Concepts
- Android isolated processes and AIDL IPC
- MPC protocols (additive secret sharing, Garbled Circuits)
- Android Keystore hardware-backed keys
- Data governance and per-feature consent
- Plugin lifecycle and safe upgrades

